     "\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<div>\r\n<div style=\"word-wrap:break-word;line-break:after-white-space\">Next Monday (3/7) is the Women in Data Science worldwide conference. There is a watch party in the DataLab or you can watch on your own. <a href=\"https://datalab.ucdavis.edu/2021/12/15/women-in-data-science-2022-datathon-and-davis-conference/\" style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif;font-size:11pt;color:rgb(5,99,193)\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://datalab.ucdavis.edu/2021/12/15/women-in-data-science-2022-datathon-and-davis-conference/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792465123989000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3Tn9OaBs8nCCvCESD7udsV\">Women\r\n in Data Science (WiDS) worldwide conference</a>\r\n<div>-W<br>\r\n<div><br>\r\n<blockquote type=\"cite\">\r\n<div>Begin forwarded message:</div>\r\n<br>\r\n<div style=\"margin-top:0px;margin-right:0px;margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:0px\">\r\n<span style=\"color:rgba(0,0,0,1.0)\"><b>From: </b></span><span>Pamela L Reynolds &lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">plrey...@ucdavis.edu</a>&gt;<br>\r\n</span></div>\r\n<div style=\"margin-top:0px;margin-right:0px;margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:0px\">\r\n<span style=\"color:rgba(0,0,0,1.0)\"><b>Subject: </b></span><span><b>[datascience-announce] [EVENT] Reminder: Women in Data Science Conference (3/7)</b><br>\r\n</span></div>\r\n<div style=\"margin-top:0px;margin-right:0px;margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:0px\">\r\n<span style=\"color:rgba(0,0,0,1.0)\"><b>Date: </b></span><span>March 2, 2022 at 6:07:28 PM PST<br>\r\n</span></div>\r\n<div style=\"margin-top:0px;margin-right:0px;margin-bottom:0px;margin-left:0px\">\r\n<span style=\"color:rgba(0,0,0,1.0)\"><b>To: </b></span><span>datascience-announce Sympa List &lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">datascienc...@ucdavis.edu</a>&gt;<br>\r\n</span></div>\r\n<br>\r\n<div>\r\n<div style=\"font-family:Helvetica;font-size:14px;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-weight:normal;letter-spacing:normal;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration:none\">\r\n<div style=\"margin:0in;font-size:11pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\">\r\nReminder the<span> </span><a href=\"https://datalab.ucdavis.edu/2021/12/15/women-in-data-science-2022-datathon-and-davis-conference/\" style=\"color:rgb(5,99,193);text-decoration:underline\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://datalab.ucdavis.edu/2021/12/15/women-in-data-science-2022-datathon-and-davis-conference/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792465123989000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3Tn9OaBs8nCCvCESD7udsV\">Women in Data Science (WiDS)\r\n worldwide conference</a><span> </span>is coming up on Monday, March 7!</div>\r\n<div style=\"margin:0in;font-size:11pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\">\r\n </div>\r\n<div style=\"margin:0in;font-size:11pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\">\r\nJoin us in DataLab’s classroom (Shields 360) to network and watch the conference live, or engage virtually with throughout the day us via Slack (#wids).</div>\r\n<div style=\"margin:0in;font-size:11pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\">\r\n </div>\r\n<div style=\"margin:0in;font-size:11pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\">\r\nFlyer with additional details, attached. We hope to see you there!</div>\r\n<div style=\"margin:0in;font-size:11pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\">\r\n </div>\r\n<div style=\"margin:0in;font-size:11pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\">\r\n--</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<div style=\"margin:0in;font-size:11pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\">\r\n<span style=\"font-size:10pt\">Pamela L. Reynolds, PhD</span><span></span></div>\r\n<div style=\"margin:0in;font-size:11pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\">\r\n<span style=\"font-size:10pt\">Associate Director</span><span></span></div>\r\n<div style=\"margin:0in;font-size:11pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\">\r\n<span style=\"font-size:10pt\">DataLab: Data Science and Informatics</span><span></span></div>\r\n<div style=\"margin:0in;font-size:11pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\">\r\n<span style=\"font-size:10pt\">University of California, Davis</span><span></span></div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div style=\"margin:0in;font-size:11pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\">\r\n<span><a href title=\"mailto:plr...@ucdavis.edu\" style=\"color:rgb(5,99,193);text-decoration:underline\" data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"color:rgb(5,99,193)\">plrey...@ucdavis.edu</span></a><br>\r\n<a href=\"https://datalab.ucdavis.edu/\" title=\"https://datalab.ucdavis.edu/\" style=\"color:rgb(5,99,193);text-decoration:underline\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://datalab.ucdavis.edu/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792465123989000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0QOGKpSV47y5w8V2g9YvWm\"><span style=\"color:rgb(5,99,193)\">https://datalab.ucdavis.edu</span></a></span></div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</blockquote>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div style=\"word-wrap:break-word;line-break:after-white-space\">\r\n<div>\r\n<div>\r\n<blockquote type=\"cite\">\r\n<div></div>\r\n</blockquote>\r\n</div>\r\n<br>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n"
